# Normalise line endings in the repository: keep LF in git, do not rewrite on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The Windows installer keeps its exact bytes. A .ps1 whose UTF-8 BOM was stripped
# silently breaks under Windows PowerShell 5.1 (the parse error looks like mojibake,
# not like an encoding problem), so git must not touch this file at all.
*.ps1 -text

# Binary-ish files that must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
